Z||000018||Return of Fiero||11-09-2001||11:16 AM||||omg, fierowrecker is very close to me!!! HIDE THE FIERO!!!! j/k i dont know where you are in lowel, but i took one of my 88 to the end of thorndike (klondike?) off the conector, and decided i was going to try to make the light where cobblestones resturaunt is (had a friend with me who thought his mustang was the best thing on wheels) and showed my fried another reason the Fiero kicked his @$$. whipped it off to the left, rear end out almost 80 deg., held it out a sec. and fishtailed it straight. to be honest, i thought i was going to park my car at the bar, close enought to throw a tip (crash) but it stuck nicely. never crashed a Fiero, but had one used as a ramp for a volvo. smacked my head on the wheel, and had a funny egg on my head.<P>Myke||||reg||12
